  "text": "About us\nProjects\nTeam\nCompetitions\nSponsor us\nJoin Marinor\nFLOAT TEST IN TRONDHEIM HARBOUR · 63.44° N · 10.42° E\nMARINOR NTNU · TRONDHEIM\nWhere robotics meets the sea.\n\nWe are a student organisation at NTNU that builds autonomous boats. Our first boat, Argus, sailed in the Njord Challenge in Trondheim in 2026.\n\nMeet Argus\nBecome a partner\nWHO WE ARE\nAutonomous boats, built by students.\n\nOur members study robotics, automation, marine technology and other subjects at NTNU. We work with the Department of Engineering Cybernetics, and we build, program and test the boats ourselves in Trondheim.\n\nMore about us\nMeet the team\nMARINOR NTNU • TRONDHEIM • EST. 2025\n35+ members\nOUR SPONSORS\nThanks to our partners.\n\nThese companies and organisations support Marinor NTNU. Without them we could not build our boats or travel to competitions.\n\nGOLD PARTNER\nSILVER PARTNERS\nBRONZE PARTNERS\n\nWant to see your logo here?\n\nBecome a partner\nOUR PROJECTS\nOur boats.\n\nArgus is finished and has been tested in the harbour. Proteus is the next boat, and we are designing it now.\n\nON THE WATER\nArgus\n\nOur first autonomous boat. A catamaran with LiDAR, a stereo depth camera and a Kongsberg Seapath 130.\n\nCATAMARAN\nLIDAR\nSTEREO CAMERA\nSEAPATH 130\nExplore Argus\nPROTEUS · DRAFT\nREV 0.1\nIN DEVELOPMENT\nProteus\n\nOur next boat. We are working on the design now.\n\nCOMING SOON\nFollow Proteus\nCOMPETITIONS\nWhere we compete.\n\nWe took Argus to the Njord Challenge in Trondheim in 2026. Next we want to go to RoboBoat in Florida.\n\n≈ 7 450 KM\nWHERE WE'RE HEADED\nTrondheim, Norway\nNjord · every August\nSarasota, Florida\nRoboBoat · every February\n2026\nFirst time at Njord\n2027\nWin Njord\nThen\nRoboBoat\nWE COMPETE HERE\nNjord\n\nA student competition in Trondheim where autonomous boats solve tasks in the harbour without anyone steering.\n\nExplore Njord\nNEXT GOAL\nRoboBoat\n\nA large competition for autonomous boats, held every February in Sarasota, Florida.\n\nExplore RoboBoat\nGET INVOLVED\nJoin us or support us.\nFOR STUDENTS\nJoin the team.\n\nWe need students in software, electronics, mechanics, design and more. You do not need any boat experience.\n\nJoin Marinor\nFOR COMPANIES\nBecome a partner.\n\nSupport the team and get to know students in robotics, automation and marine technology at NTNU.\n\nPartner with us\n\nA student organisation at NTNU in Trondheim that builds autonomous boats.\n\nmarinorntnu@gmail.com\nCopy\nHøgskoleringen 1\n7034 Trondheim\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nMARINOR\nHome\nAbout us\nTeam\nCompetitions\nOUR WORK\nArgus\nProteus\nNjord Challenge\nRoboBoat\nGET INVOLVED\nJoin the crew\nSponsor us\nEmail us\n© 2026 Marinor NTNU\nOrg.nr. 936 064 809\nBack to top",
